# Model caches downloaded by fastembed at runtime. We let the cache live
# wherever the workload is run from; project-root downloads must not be
# committed (bge-small alone is 126 MB, past GitHub's 100 MB hard limit).
.fastembed_cache/
**/.fastembed_cache/
